  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"CqaA3\" id=\"CqaA3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7b9d786e\" id=\"u7b9d786e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75)\">0&gt; 功能需求</span></strong></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uaa3b5ffb\" id=\"uaa3b5ffb\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc01c9f4\" id=\"udc01c9f4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">设计一个简易计算器，能够完成【+，-，*，/，%】5种运算；</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lqL26%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"Kp2C5\" id=\"Kp2C5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua8f703be\" id=\"ua8f703be\">1&gt; 计算器-加法功能</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%99%A8-V1.0%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20num1%20%3D%205%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20num2%20%3D%206%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20y%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%5Cn%20%20%20%20y%20%3D%20num1%20%2B%20num2%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3A%20%25d%20%2B%20%25d%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20num1%2C%20num2%2C%20y)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%99%A8-V1.0%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zkkJy%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u662e39c5\" id=\"u662e39c5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub33bacd4\" id=\"ub33bacd4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">代码问题：缺乏复用性</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud4c38e35\" id=\"ud4c38e35\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud5a6d3bc\" id=\"ud5a6d3bc\">加法逻辑直接硬编码在main()中，无法在其他地方复用</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b798ecd\" id=\"u0b798ecd\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f51fd50\" id=\"u0f51fd50\">如果程序其他部分也需要加法运算，必须重复编写 num1 + num2</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FgpzY%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u75390240\" id=\"u75390240\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0221b618\" id=\"u0221b618\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">封装函数：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%99%A8-V2.0%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%5Cnint%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%20%2B%20b%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20num1%20%3D%205%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20num2%20%3D%206%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20y%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20y%20%3D%20add(num1%2C%20num2)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3A%20%25d%20%2B%20%25d%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20num1%2C%20num2%2C%20y)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%99%A8-V2.0%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MsGN5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u94661646\" id=\"u94661646\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub65ca7b2\" id=\"ub65ca7b2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">优化后的优点：遵循&quot;单一职责原则&quot;（一个函数只做一件事）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2c378966\" id=\"u2c378966\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2c8ac3aa\" id=\"u2c8ac3aa\">加法逻辑只写一次，可以在程序中多次调用</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4de2d5a4\" id=\"u4de2d5a4\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b9ed62e\" id=\"u0b9ed62e\">例如，如果需要在程序中多处做加法运算，只需调用 add() 函数，而不需要重复写 a + b；</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QGKIt%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"vNKTl\" id=\"vNKTl\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18d438f2\" id=\"u18d438f2\">2&gt; 函数基本概念</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"udeb6ab52\" id=\"udeb6ab52\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udc39ce20\" id=\"udc39ce20\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75)\">函数（function）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3bbd2ab6\" id=\"u3bbd2ab6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75)\">：编程中封装的一段具有特定功能的代码；</span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F43021193%2F1725282080337-5fde7982-b577-4523-aba1-03a5439b9853.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uabdabd72-45dd-441f-954b-6d10b03f597%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc20da17b-12f0-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A490.2825927734375%2C%22height%22%3A423%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A330046%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A986%2C%22originHeight%22%3A850%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.399999976158142%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8A%A0%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A372%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A186%2C%22